      "approach": "Focused session, tech lead alone, new angle: the shadcn/ui registry (registry/shadcn). A fresh `shadcn init -t vite -p nova` app (test/dogfood/shadcn, port 5184) installed all six blocks with `npx shadcn add` from a local registry build; @wick-charts/react 0.8.3 from npm. Captured every block idle + hover in light and dark, a runtime `.dark` toggle, colored --chart-N tokens set on <html> at runtime, the full page at 375 px. Compared the crosshair pill with the docs line page.",
      "notes": [
        "The Nova preset ships grayscale --chart-1..5 (chart-1 is oklch(0.87 0 0)): anything colored by series color goes near-invisible on a light card. Test light themes with the default palette, not only ?tokens=color.",
        "Tailwind preflight sets a unitless line-height that DOM overlays inherit; compare overlay geometry against the docs page before calling a misalignment Tailwind-only.",
        "No agents needed: six registry blocks fit one tech-lead pass (about 25 captures)."
      ]
    }
